Why: css/shared/onboard.css's ob-bounce hops by `translate: 0 -10%`; Chrome's computed `translate` keeps the percentage
("0px -7.7%"), which the old regex (px only) read as 0, so every lit HTML control's box followed its hop (the door's Ha!, the
eye test's haa/na, any ob-lit pill in a box).
